Bos, beres. Semua cek lulus, sudah di-commit.

**Status ✅**

**Dikerjakan**

`main.py` (191 baris, 7.7 KB) — ditulis sendiri dari nol, stdlib only (`hashlib, os, shutil, struct, sys, zlib, pathlib`):

- Docstring: image itu front page 20 Nov 2026 (7 cerita, 6 benua), program cuma nyerahin byte-nya; tanpa network, tanpa kode pihak ketiga.
- Baca `MAKEFUN_INPUT_DIR` (default `/input`) & `MAKEFUN_OUTPUT_DIR` (default `/output`), `mkdir(parents=True, exist_ok=True)`.
- Sumber dari `Path(__file__).resolve().parent / "entry.png"` → aman untuk mount read-only `/bot`.
- Validasi, gagal = `SystemExit` pesan jelas: signature PNG, `IHDR` (width/height + bit depth/colour type/compression/interlace), ≤1 MiB, ≤1024×1024, dan CRC tiap chunk via `zlib.crc32` sambil jalan chunk list (IHDR wajib pertama, IEND wajib terakhir, tidak boleh ada byte nyasar setelah IEND). Komentar menjelaskan kenapa: image rusak/kelebihan → Valid=0, tidak dapat hadiah.
- `shutil.copyfile`, lalu baca balik + banding SHA-256 (jaga-jaga short write).
- Output print deterministik: dimensi, byte, jumlah chunk, digest — tanpa timestamp/path absolut/random.

`README.md` — entry bounty news-image-20261120, isi front page hari Jumat 20 Nov 2026, tabel 7 cerita + asal tiap cerita (wires India/IMD, pleno COP31 Antalya, dispatch Washington–Teluk, laporan IAEA Yongbyon, agenda UNSC Sudan, dispatch Brasília/pasar, berita aksesi treaty Argentina), penjelasan `main.py`, lisensi MIT, cara run lokal.

**Hasil verifikasi (output asli)**

```
$ python3 -c "import ast,sys; ast.parse(open('main.py').read())"
exit=0

$ python3 -c "import ast; ast.parse(open('main.py').read(), feature_version=(3,13)); print('ok')"
ok
exit=0

$ mkdir -p /tmp/outtest && MAKEFUN_OUTPUT_DIR=/tmp/outtest python3 main.py
entry.png: 1024x1024, 182846 bytes, 5 chunks, every CRC ok, sha256 d8b3b099f7235fae4395a02680ba402b2a9c28dc8b74b0ba18c7d59f849259a6
copied bit for bit to entry.png in the output directory
read nothing from the input directory (input)
exit=0

$ cmp entry.png /tmp/outtest/entry.png
exit=0   (identik)

$ # dua run ke dir berbeda
cmp /tmp/outA/entry.png /tmp/outB/entry.png   → exit=0
cmp /tmp/a.txt /tmp/b.txt                     → exit=0  (stdout pun identik)
d8b3b099f7235fae4395a02680ba402b2a9c28dc8b74b0ba18c7d59f849259a6  entry.png
d8b3b099f7235fae4395a02680ba402b2a9c28dc8b74b0ba18c7d59f849259a6  /tmp/outtest/entry.png
d8b3b099f7235fae4395a02680ba402b2a9c28dc8b74b0ba18c7d59f849259a6  /tmp/outA/entry.png
d8b3b099f7235fae4395a02680ba402b2a9c28dc8b74b0ba18c7d59f849259a6  /tmp/outB/entry.png

$ grep -nE "import (PIL|requests|numpy)" main.py
(no output) grep exit=1

$ # gaya grader: -P -s, /bot read-only
cd /tmp/bot && MAKEFUN_INPUT_DIR=/tmp/bot MAKEFUN_OUTPUT_DIR=/tmp/botout python3 -P -s /tmp/bot/main.py
exit=0 ; cmp entry.png /tmp/botout/entry.png → identik
```

Uji guard (tiap kasus exit=1, pesan jelas): signature salah (`bad PNG signature`), CRC dirusak (`chunk b'IDAT' ... has CRC 0x7aa0a8c4, but its bytes give 0xc0d8e528`), file dipotong (`the file ends at 182816`), >1 MiB (`1048577 bytes is over the 1 MiB limit`), lebar 4096 (`4096 by 1024 pixels is over the 1024 by 1024 limit`), tanpa IEND (`no IEND chunk`), entry.png hilang.

